      "text": "Project Fugu: An initiative to bring \"Desktop-level\" capabilities to the\nweb (e.g., accessing local files, Bluetooth, or USB).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Project Fugu: An initiative to bring \"Desktop-level\" capabilities to the web (e.g., accessing local files, Bluetooth, or USB).",
